        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: بسنت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بسنت — basant — \"the spring kite festival\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "لاہور میں بسنت کا میلہ تھا۔ Lāhaur meṅ basant kā melā thā. There was a spring kite fair in Lahore."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "بسنت (basant) is inherited from Sanskrit vasanta, \"spring\" (Monier-Williams). In Lahore it names the day of kites at the end of winter."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
